# Close Encounter {1}{G}: "As an additional cost to cast this spell, choose a creature you control or a warped creature card you
# own in exile. Close Encounter deals damage equal to the power of the chosen creature or card to target creature." On turn 1
# Bot1 casts Red Tiger Mechan (3/3) for its warp cost {1}{R}, and warp exiles it at that end step: a warped card in exile
# (CR 702.185b). On turn 3 Bot1 controls no creature and chooses the Mechan in exile: Bot2's Aegis Turtle (0/5) is dealt 3.
# The choice is of exactly one (CR 601.2h): none is refused, and so is Bot2's Turtle, a creature Bot1 doesn't control.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Red Tiger Mechan
Forest
Close Encounter
Mountain x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Aegis Turtle
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Red Tiger Mechan.Cast(Ability: Warp)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
? Exile = Red Tiger Mechan
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Aegis Turtle.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Close Encounter.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Aegis Turtle)
! Bot1.Choose()
! Bot1.Choose(Aegis Turtle)
Bot1.Choose(Choose creature you control or warped creature card you own in exile)
Bot1.Choose(Red Tiger Mechan)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

